GfTfzanUUjQ&oe=6AFEFFA0"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2026-02-23 at 14.13.31.png", "id": "2259097167946285", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823790_2259097174612951_8018597952037061695_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rKK6ZROKnPYQ7kNvwHiF8fb&_nc_oc=AdqiW8w7vAqeJtLyKUOJdZmbOkLkHFZK6KOosDh6yiiTkXXIU7LFZMluzyotCWq7_A0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQoXDyUvagiH5hc_Be6G2KYsCLobbQv3TvsX7cxcvOL8Q&oe=6AFF260A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Shine & Steel", "keywords": ["job", "simulator", "weapons", "workshop", "clean"], "long_description": "In this crafting experience, you step into the role of a weaponsmith. Clean & Restore forgotten weapons before selling them to customers! \n\n# \ud83d\udde1\ufe0f RESTORE FORGOTTEN WEAPONS TO THEIR PRIME \ud83d\udde1\ufe0f\nFind the correct tool and weapon part to do your job! \n - Chip off the rust \ud83d\udd28\n{1233957612179784} \n- Scrub away corrosion \ud83e\uddfd \n {953596590566990}\n- Wash away dirt \ud83e\udea3\n {4343525485901896} \n- Polish steel until it reflects the light!\u2728\n{3498929596929679}\n {1459084948964156}\n\nYour task is simple: give these weapons a second life.\n\n# \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f REASSEMBLE EVERY PART WITH SATISFYING PRECISION \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f\nCarefully reassemble weapons parts, and sell them to the mysterious customers.\n\nA cozy game with no pressure, just hands-on blacksmith experience focused on care, precision, and craftsmanship.\n\n{1246492230179385}\n{2201857980556663}", "short_description": "Clean and restore curious forgotten weapons in your own medieval workshop. Clean away rust, reassemble parts, and sell them to customers!"}]}, "developer_name": "AtLab 5", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mVuDdW_4rgq23xd2injdFz9Y-R6LheSqWOaWxUtT8h8/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_nam